  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tAccounts Production\n\t\tAccounts Production Help Guide\n\n### AP: Adding Company Secretaries\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 25 Jun, 2026 at  3:06 PM\n\n### Overview\n\nThe Secretaries section allows you to add and manage company secretaries within Accounts Production. Secretary information can be maintained for company records and can also be displayed on the Company's Information page within generated reports.\n\n### Navigation\n\nAccounts Production > Settings > Report Settings > Company Contacts > Secretaries\n\n### Step 1: Add a New Secretary\n\nClick + Add New Secretary.\n\nA Contact Details page will open where you can enter the secretary's information.\n\nComplete the relevant secretary information, including the secretary's name and any additional details required.\n\nOnce all information has been entered, click Save.\n\n### Step 2: Display the Secretary on Company Reports\n\nIf you would like the secretary's name to appear on the Company's Information page within generated reports, select the Show on Company Information Page checkbox.\n\n### \n\n### Step 3: Edit or Delete a Secretary\n\nYou can manage existing secretary records using the available actions.\n\n - Edit – Update the secretary's information.\n\n - Delete – Remove the secretary from the company records.\n\n### Additional Help\n\n### Need Help?\n\nIf you need assistance or guidance, please contact your onboarding manager or email Support@capium.com, or call us on 020 3322 5578.\n\n### Related Articles\n\nAP: Adding Company Directors\nAP: Adding Company Contacts\n\nAccounting Periods\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115345\">Accounts Production</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188540\">Accounts Production Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">AP: Adding Company Secretaries\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Thu, 25 Jun, 2026 at  3:06 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<h2><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Overview</span></strong></h2><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">The <strong>Secretaries</strong> section allows you to add and manage company secretaries within Accounts Production. Secretary information can be maintained for company records and can also be displayed on the Company's Information page within generated reports.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><hr style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>Navigation</strong></span></h2><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Accounts Production &gt; Settings &gt; Report Settings &gt; Company Contacts &gt; Secretaries</strong></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><em dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9250565317/original/Y0sVZg9Oo8cC_SvFwp7wcG7mYTtondkUZA.png?1782396153\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9250565317\"></em></span></p><hr style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><h3 style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Step 1: Add a New Secretary</strong></span></h3><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Click <strong>+ Add New Secretary</strong>.</span></p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">A Contact Details page will open where you can enter the secretary's information.</span></p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><em dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9250565418/original/fE58nLPMKy0MEObGURcWEfPAHE9NjhSLOg.png?1782396219\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9250565418\"></em></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Complete the relevant secretary information, including the secretary's name and any additional details required.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Once all information has been entered, click <strong>Save</strong>.</span></p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><hr style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>Step 2: Display the Secretary on Company Reports</strong></span></h3><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">If you would like the secretary's name to appear on the Company's Information page within generated reports, select the <strong>Show on Company Information Page</strong> checkbox.</span></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9250565574/original/6r8AkyGNEsvCImbnuxFSkW2K95D9HWmDGg.png?1782396312\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9250565574\"></span></h3><hr style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><h3 style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>Step 3: Edit or Delete a Secretary</strong></span></h3><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">You can manage existing secretary records using the available actions.</span></p><ul style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><li><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>Edit</strong> – Update the secretary's information.</span></p></li><li><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>Delete</strong> – Remove the secretary from the company records.</span></p></li></ul><hr style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>Additional Help</strong></span></h2><h3 style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Need Help?</span></h3><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">If you need assistance or guidance, please contact your onboarding manager or email <strong><a href=\"mailto:Support@capium.com\">Support@capium.com</a></strong>, or call us on <strong>020 3322 5578</strong>.</span></p><hr style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>Related Articles</strong></span></h2><ul><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(18, 51, 76); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://capium.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/9000165488/edit?portalId=9000044273\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 63, 210);\">AP: Adding Company Directors</a></span></strong></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(18, 51, 76); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(18, 51, 76); word-break: normal; ove